{"id":849,"date":"2016-04-23T13:49:26","date_gmt":"2016-04-23T18:49:26","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbbaldwin.wordpress.com\/?p=849"},"modified":"2016-04-23T13:49:26","modified_gmt":"2016-04-23T18:49:26","slug":"quilts-at-the-north-ranch","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2016\/04\/23\/quilts-at-the-north-ranch\/","title":{"rendered":"Quilts at The North Ranch"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>On our first day at <a href=\"https:\/\/www.escapees.com\/parking\/rainbow-parks\/congress-arizona\" target=\"_blank\">The North Ranch<\/a>, we took a walking tour of the clubhouse and grounds to &#8220;scope it out&#8221;.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_872\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-872\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-872\" src=\"\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-23-11-18-03.jpg\" alt=\"2016-04-23 11.18.03\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-23-11-18-03.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-23-11-18-03-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-23-11-18-03-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-23-11-18-03-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-872\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">The North Ranch Clubhouse at Congress, AZ<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>The clubhouse has two large rooms, one is carpeted, offers a large brick fireplace, lots of comfy chairs and couches, along with ample shelves stocked with books to share on loan. \u00a0This room is used for social gatherings including the jam session Kathy and I attended on Wednesday.<\/p>\n<p>The second large room has a tiled floor and is used for various more physical activities including exercising, bingo, quilting workshops, etc. \u00a0I wanted to share with you some of the pix I took of all the various quilts that residents have made and put on display.<\/p>\n<div id='gallery-1' class='gallery galleryid-849 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail'><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-18-17-48-53.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-18-17-48-53-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-18-17-49-06.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-18-17-49-06-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-18-17-50-10.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-18-17-50-10-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>On our first day at The North Ranch, we took a walking tour of the clubhouse and grounds to &#8220;scope it out&#8221;. The clubhouse has two large rooms, one is carpeted, offers a large brick fireplace, lots of comfy chairs and couches, along with ample shelves stocked with books to share on loan. \u00a0This room &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2016\/04\/23\/quilts-